  Strings for the thread detail screens.

  Anything that already exists in strings.xml and reads correctly here is reused
  rather than restated - the confirmation bodies for clearing history, blocking
  and leaving are shared with the thread list, and the mute durations come from
  MuteDuration, so a translator only ever sees one copy of each sentence.
-->
